\[ \bigcup \bigl\{\mathtt I(\mathbf i_m): \mathbf i_m  \in \mathbb I_m^{\ast} \bigr\} \setminus \bigl(\mathscr{E}_m \cap E_m \bigr) \]  consists of at most finitely many points, and is thus of measure zero according to any of the densities $\varphi_{\mathtt M}$. For $\mathtt M \geq m$, the mass assigned to $\mathscr{E}_m$ by $\varphi_{\mathtt M}$ is therefore
