\end{align*} 
which is the desired inequality \eqref{Frostman-nonspecial-scales}. If $(\tilde{\ell}_0, \ldots, \tilde{\ell}_{j-1}) \in \mathscr{D}_m^j$, then \eqref{choice-of-theta} and \eqref{favoured-numbers} give    
