\noindent {\em{Case 2: }} If $\mathtt s^{\mathtt a} \nmid \xi$, then \eqref{def-A}-\eqref{B*C} and Lemma \ref{BC-lemma} yield different expressions for $\mathfrak A$ and $\mathfrak C$:  
