For brevity of notation, we will write $\mathfrak G = \mathfrak B_1 \times \mathfrak A_2$, where $\mathfrak B_1$ and $\mathfrak A_2$ denote the first and second factors of \eqref{def-G} respectively. Using the expressions of $\mathfrak A$ and $\mathfrak B$ from \eqref{def-A} and \eqref{def-B}, and the trivial bound $|\mathfrak B_1^{\ast}|, |\mathfrak A_2| \leq 1$ from \eqref{B*C-trivial-bound},  we find that
